  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, $\\quad f^{\\prime}(x) \\leq 5$\r\n$\\frac{f(7)-f(2)}{x-2} \\leq 5$\r\n(by Lagrange mean value theorem] $\\begin{array}{ll}\\Rightarrow & \\frac{f(7)-3}{7-2} \\leq 5 \\\\ \\Rightarrow & f(7) \\leq 5(7-2)+3 \\\\ \\therefore & f(7) \\leq 28\\end{array}$",
    "image": null
